      "label": "2.49.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "सूतैति एव च आभाष्य सारथिम् तम् अभीक्ष्णशः |\nहंस मत्त स्वरः श्रीमान् उवाच पुरुष ऋषभः",
      "iast": "sūtaiti eva ca ābhāṣya sārathim tam abhīkṣṇaśaḥ |\nhaṃsa matta svaraḥ śrīmān uvāca puruṣa ṛṣabhaḥ",
      "translation": "The glorious Rama, the foremost among men, whose voice resembled the cackling of a swan in rut, addressed the charioteer with great affection, in the words \"Oh, charioteer!\" and spoke as follows :",
