      "devanagari": "न अत्यर्थम् अभिकान्क्षामि मृगयाम् सरयू वने |\nरतिर् हि एषा अतुला लोके राज ऋषि गण सम्मता\nराजर्षीणाम् हि लोकेऽस्मिन् रत्यर्थम् मृगया वने |\nकाले कृताम् ताम् मनुजैर्धन्विनामभिकाङ्क्षिताम्",
      "iast": "na atyartham abhikānkṣāmi mṛgayām sarayū vane |\nratir hi eṣā atulā loke rāja ṛṣi gaṇa sammatā\nrājarśhīṇām hi loke'smin ratyartham mṛgayā vane |\nkāle kṛtām tām manujairdhanvināmabhikāṇ^kśitām",
      "translation": "\"I do not hanker much after hunting in the woodlands bordering on Sarayu river. In fact it is a delightful spot, made much of in the world by hosts of royal sages. Hunting in the forest is indeed for gratification of royal sages in this world. At times; the bow- men adopted it. But I do not long for it excessively.\"",
